  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPrincipal (P) = ₹400\n\nAmount (A) = ₹529\n\nTime (T) = 2 years\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nA = P × (1 + R/100)T\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 529 = 400 × (1 + R/100)²\n\n⇒ (1 + R/100)² = 529 ÷ 400\n\n⇒ (1 + R/100)² = 1.3225\n\n⇒ 1 + R/100 = √1.3225\n\n⇒ 1 + R/100 = 1.15\n\n⇒ R/100 = 1.15 - 1\n\n⇒ R/100 = 0.15\n\n⇒ R = 0.15 × 100\n\n⇒ R = 15%\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 15%.**",
